OL,3,GNEWSADrugs and disorder at flats leads
OL,4,Ato police action
OL,5,
OL,6,FA closure order has been put in place
OL,7,Fby police at a block of flats after
OL,8,Fresidents reported drug offences,
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour and buzzers
OL,10,Frepeatedly being pressed to gain entry.
OL,12,FUntil 10 November, anyone entering the
OL,13,Fflats on Byfield Road in Northampton
OL,14,F"without reasonable excuse may be
OL,15,Fcommitting a criminal offence and could
OL,16,Fbe arrested", said Northamptonshire
OL,17,FPolice.
OL,19,FSgt Grace Manwaring said the behaviour
OL,20,Fwas having "a significant impact on
OL,21,Fresidents and the wider community".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
